Dialogue: 5,0:22:40.10,0:22:43.62,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}-こんばんは～！   -あら～ こんばんは～！
Dialogue: 6,0:22:43.62,0:22:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}啊 来啦！
Dialogue: 5,0:22:43.62,0:22:45.48,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}あ～ 来た～！
