Dialogue: 6,0:33:25.26,0:33:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}嗯？
Dialogue: 5,0:33:25.26,0:33:26.28,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}うん？
