Dialogue: 5,0:33:44.75,0:33:47.76,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}ん？ 友達が 何？
Dialogue: 6,0:33:47.76,0:33:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}关于密友是多么的棒！
Dialogue: 5,0:33:47.76,0:33:50.13,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}親友の すばらしさとかさ！
