Dialogue: 5,0:33:50.55,0:33:52.91,Default-L2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}言ったね
Dialogue: 6,0:33:53.15,0:33:55.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}{\fad(120,120)}莫非这个世界要终结了吗？
